<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AEGIS — Conversational AI with 3D Motion</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }
    html, body { height: 100%; }
    body {
      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 75% -10%, rgba(56,189,248,0.10), transparent 60%),
                  radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 10% 110%, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.08), transparent 60%),
                  #020617;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #0f172a; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #334155; border-radius: 8px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #475569; }

    .glass {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }
    .glow-blue  { box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(56,189,248,0.18), inset 0 0 24px rgba(56,189,248,0.04); }
    .glow-teal  { box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(45,212,191,0.18), inset 0 0 24px rgba(45,212,191,0.04); }
    .grid-fade {
      background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(51,65,85,0.16) 1px, transparent 1px),
                        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(51,65,85,0.16) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 24px 24px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 40%, transparent 78%);
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 40%, transparent 78%);
    }
    .pulse-dot { animation: pulseDot 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes pulseDot {
      0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(52,211,153,0.6); }
      50%     { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(52,211,153,0); }
    }
    .typewriter-caret::after { content: "▍"; color: #38bdf8; animation: blink 0.9s steps(2, start) infinite; }
    @keyframes blink { to { visibility: hidden; } }
    .preset-btn {
      font-size: 10px; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(45,212,191,0.35); color: #5eead4;
      background: rgba(45,212,191,0.06); transition: all .2s ease;
    }
    .preset-btn:hover { background: rgba(45,212,191,0.16); border-color: rgba(45,212,191,0.7); color: #ccfbf1; }
    .step-item { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: all .25s ease; }
    .step-num { flex: none; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1e3a5f; color: #7dd3fc; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .step-name { display: block; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }
    .step-detail { margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .step-item.step-active { border-color: rgba(56,189,248,0.5); background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); }
    .step-item.step-active .step-num { background: #0ea5e9; color: #02121f; }
    .step-item.step-active .step-name { color: #7dd3fc; }
    .fade-up { animation: fadeUp 0.45s ease both; }
    @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
    .code-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <!-- ═══════════ HEADER ═══════════ -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 glass border-b border-slate-800/80 px-4 py-3">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/30 to-teal-400/30 border border-blue-400/40 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-black text-blue-300 glow-blue">
          ⬡
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-lg font-bold leading-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 via-cyan-300 to-teal-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            AEGIS Conversational Engine
          </h1>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono -mt-0.5">neural · spatial · reactive</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span id="status-pill" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/70 text-slate-300">
          <span id="status-dot" class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 pulse-dot"></span>
          <span id="status-text">System Ready</span>
        </span>
        <button id="demo-btn" class="text-[11px] font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-teal-500 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-teal-400 text-white transition shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/40">
          ⚡ Live Demo
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ═══════════ MAIN ═══════════ -->
  <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-4 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

    <!-- ─────── LEFT COLUMN ─────── -->
    <section class="lg:col-span-1 space-y-4">

      <!-- API Key card -->
      <div class="glass border border-slate-700/60 rounded-xl p-4 glow-blue fade-up">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <label class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Gemini API Key</label>
          <button id="toggle-key" class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-300 font-mono">show</button>
        </div>
        <input id="api-key-input" type="password" placeholder="Paste AI Studio Key (AIzaSy...)" autocomplete="off"
          class="w-full bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg py-2 px-3 text-xs font-mono focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 text-slate-100 transition">
        <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-1.5">Key stays in your browser. No key? Press <span class="text-teal-400 font-semibold">⚡ Live Demo</span>.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Query card -->
      <div class="glass border border-slate-700/60 rounded-xl p-4 glow-teal fade-up">
        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Ask Anything</label>
        <div class="relative flex items-center">
          <input id="query-input" type="text" placeholder="Ask a question or request a demo..."
            class="w-full bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg py-2 pl-3 pr-10 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-teal-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500/20 text-slate-100 transition">
          <button id="mic-btn" title="Voice input" class="absolute right-2.5 text-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-teal-300 transition">
            🎙
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2 mt-3">
          <button id="analyze-btn" class="flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-500 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-cyan-400 text-white font-semibold py-2 rounded-lg text-sm transition shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/40 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-wait">
            Ask AI Engine
          </button>
          <button id="demo-btn-2" title="Run built-in demo (no API key)" class="px-3 rounded-lg border border-teal-500/50 text-teal-300 hover:bg-teal-500/10 text-lg transition">⚡</button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-1.5 mt-2 flex-wrap">
          <button data-preset="pacman maze: a ghost chases pac-man and predicts its next move, explain the chase algorithm" class="preset-btn">🍒 Pac-Man</button>
          <button data-preset="sudoku backtracking solver scanning the 9x9 grid" class="preset-btn">🧩 Sudoku</button>
          <button data-preset="spiral matrix traversal" class="preset-btn">🌀 Spiral</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Response card -->
      <div class="glass border border-slate-700/60 rounded-xl p-4 fade-up">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">AI Response</h2>
          <span id="engine-chip" class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-700 text-slate-500">status: idle</span>
        </div>
        <div id="analysis-summary" class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-3 min-h-[120px]">
          <p class="text-slate-500 italic text-xs">Ask a question above — the 3D agent will fly a path that visualizes the algorithm's behavior.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ghost chase card (Pac-Man style queries) -->
        <div id="ghost-block" class="mt-3 hidden border border-red-500/30 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <div class="bg-red-950/60 px-2 py-1 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-red-300 font-bold">👻 Ghost Prediction &amp; Chase Algorithm</div>
          <div class="p-2 text-[11px] text-slate-300 space-y-1">
            <p><span class="text-red-300 font-semibold">Algorithm:</span> <span id="ghost-algo" class="text-slate-200">—</span></p>
            <p><span class="text-red-300 font-semibold">Predicted next cell:</span> <span id="ghost-next" class="font-mono text-amber-300">—</span></p>
            <p><span class="text-red-300 font-semibold">Why this move:</span> <span id="ghost-why" class="text-slate-400 block mt-0.5">—</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─────── RIGHT COLUMN ─────── -->
    <section class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">

      <!-- 3D Canvas -->
      <div id="stage" class="relative bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl h-[420px] overflow-hidden glow-blue fade-up">
        <div class="grid-fade absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div id="canvas-container" class="absolute inset-0"></div>

        <!-- HUD top-left -->
        <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 z-10 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-slate-800 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Dynamic 3D Agent Demonstrator
        </div>

        <!-- HUD top-right -->
        <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5">
          <div class="flex gap-1.5">
            <button id="reset-cam" title="Reset camera" class="bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-300 transition">⌂ Reset</button>
            <button id="toggle-cam" title="Toggle auto-rotate" class="bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-300 transition">⟳ Orbit</button>
            <button id="follow-cam" title="Chase-cam: camera rides behind the agent" class="bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-300 transition">🎥 Follow</button>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2 py-1">
            <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-slate-400">⏩</span>
            <input id="speed-slider" type="range" min="0.25" max="3" step="0.05" value="1" class="w-24 accent-teal-400 cursor-pointer">
            <span id="speed-val" class="text-[9px] font-mono text-teal-300 w-8 text-right">1.0×</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Hover tooltip: why the agent chose each waypoint -->
        <div id="wp-info" class="absolute bottom-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 pointer-events-none bg-slate-900/90 border border-teal-500/40 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-teal-200 max-w-[94%] text-center">
          Hover a numbered waypoint to see why the agent chose that next move.
        </div>

        <!-- HUD top-center: always-visible algorithm label -->
        <div id="stage-algo" class="absolute top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 pointer-events-none bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur border border-teal-500/40 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-teal-300 flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap max-w-[80%]">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400 animate-pulse shrink-0"></span>
          <span id="stage-algo-text" class="truncate">Algorithm: —</span>
        </div>

        <!-- HUD bottom: active algorithm banner -->
        <div id="algo-banner" class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 z-10 pointer-events-none opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 translate-y-2">
          <div class="bg-slate-900/85 backdrop-blur border border-blue-500/40 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <span class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 font-bold block">Active Animation Algorithm</span>
              <span id="algo-name" class="text-sm font-semibold text-teal-300 block truncate">—</span>
              <span id="step-line" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 block truncate">—</span>
              <span id="ghost-line" class="text-[10px] text-red-300/90 block truncate">—</span>
            </div>
            <span id="travel-pct" class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 shrink-0">0%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Engine Log / Code Context -->
      <div class="glass border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 fade-up">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Engine Log / Code Context</span>
          <button id="clear-log" class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2 py-0.5 transition">clear</button>
        </div>
        <pre class="bg-slate-950/90 p-3 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300 border border-slate-800/80 h-44 overflow-y-auto code-scroll"><code id="code-view"><span class="text-slate-500">// AEGIS engine online. Awaiting instructions...</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="text-center text-[10px] text-slate-600 font-mono py-4 border-t border-slate-800/60">
    AEGIS v2.0 · Three.js r128 · Gemini API · drag to orbit · scroll to zoom · hover numbered waypoints for the "why" · 🎥 follow-cam · ⏩ speed
  </footer>

  <script>
    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       0. ESCAPING + DOM HELPERS
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    function esc(s) {
      return String(s).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/"/g, '&quot;');
    }
    function log(msg, color = '#7dd3fc') {
      const el = document.getElementById('code-view');
      const t = new Date().toLocaleTimeString('en-GB');
      const line = document.createElement('div');
      line.innerHTML = `<span style="color:#475569">▸ ${t}</span> <span style="color:${color}">${esc(msg)}</span>`;
      el.appendChild(line);
      el.parentElement.scrollTop = el.parentElement.scrollHeight;
    }
    function setStatus(text, kind = 'ok') {
      const dot = document.getElementById('status-dot');
      const pill = document.getElementById('status-pill');
      document.getElementById('status-text').textContent = text;
      dot.className = 'w-2 h-2 rounded-full pulse-dot ' +
        (kind === 'busy' ? 'bg-amber-400' : kind === 'err' ? 'bg-red-400' : 'bg-emerald-400');
      pill.className = 'flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border ' +
        (kind === 'busy' ? 'border-amber-500/40 bg-slate-900/70 text-amber-300'
          : kind === 'err' ? 'border-red-500/40 bg-slate-900/70 text-red-300'
          : 'border-emerald-500/30 bg-slate-900/70 text-slate-300');
    }
    function setChip(text) {
      document.getElementById('engine-chip').textContent = 'status: ' + text;
    }
    function showBanner(name) {
      document.getElementById('algo-name').textContent = name || 'Custom Trajectory Path';
      const b = document.getElementById('algo-banner');
      b.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-2');
    }
    function hideBanner() {
      document.getElementById('algo-banner').classList.add('opacity-0', 'translate-y-2');
    }
    function typeInto(el, text, speed = 8) {
      el.innerHTML = '';
      let i = 0;
      el.classList.add('typewriter-caret');
      (function step() {
        if (i <= text.length) {
          el.textContent = text.slice(0, i);
          i++;
          setTimeout(step, speed);
        } else {
          el.classList.remove('typewriter-caret');
        }
      })();
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       1. THREE.JS — GLOBALS & SCENE BUILD
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    let scene, camera, renderer, controls;
    let agentGroup, outerRing, innerRing, coreMesh, satellites = [];
    let trailLine, starLayerA, starLayerB;
    let targetMarker, beamMesh;
    let splineCurve = null;
    let animationProgress = 0;
    let isAnimating = false;
    let isFlying = false;          // true while travelling the spline
    let lastTangent = new THREE.Vector3();
    const trail = [];
    const MAX_TRAIL = 72;
    const ripples = [];
    const pellets = [];      // pacman-style collectibles
    const gridHints = [];    // grid cell markers
    let decoGroup = null;    // topic-aware scene decorations
    let eatenCount = 0;
    let pelletsDone = false;
    let steps = [];        // step-by-step breakdown (synced to flight)
    let lastStep = -1;
    let stepItems = [];
    // Ghost chase (Pac-Man style)
    let ghostGroup = null, ghostNextMarker = null, ghostArrow = null;
    let ghostSpline = null, ghostWaypoints = [];
    let ghostProgress = 0, ghostActive = false, ghostSpeed = 0.78;

    /* ── Interactive path-visualization helpers (visualization only) ── */
    const raycaster = new THREE.Raycaster();
    const mouseNDC = new THREE.Vector2();
    const camAnchor = new THREE.Vector3(10, 11, 15);
    const STEP_COLORS = [0x38bdf8, 0x22d3ee, 0x34d399, 0xfacc15, 0xfb923c, 0xf87171, 0xe879f9, 0x818cf8];
    let wpMarkers = [], wpPillars = [];   // numbered decision beacons + their pillars (raycast targets)
    let phaseRibbon = null;               // ground path ribbon colored by algorithm phase
    let activeWp = -1;
    let prevTangentValid = false;
    let speedMul = 1;                     // user flight-speed multiplier
    let followMode = false;               // cinematic chase-camera mode

    function init3D() {
      const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');
      const W = container.clientWidth, H = container.clientHeight;

      scene = new THREE.Scene();
      scene.background = new THREE.Color(0x020617);
      scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x020617, 0.022);

      camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(48, W / H, 0.1, 1000);
      camera.position.set(10, 11, 15);
      camera.lookAt(0, 1, 0);

      renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });
      renderer.setSize(W, H);
      renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));
      renderer.shadowMap.enabled = false;
      container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);

      /* ── Lighting ── */
      scene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0x24344d, 1.6));

      const key = new THREE.SpotLight(0x38bdf8, 3.2);
      key.position.set(0, 22, 12);
      key.angle = Math.PI / 4.5;
      key.penumbra = 0.9;
      scene.add(key);

      const rim = new THREE.PointLight(0x2dd4bf, 2.2, 40);
      rim.position.set(-10, -4, -8);
      scene.add(rim);

      const fill = new THREE.PointLight(0x6366f1, 1.6, 40);
      fill.position.set(8, 6, -10);
      scene.add(fill);

      /* ── Ground grid ── */
      const grid = new THREE.GridHelper(30, 30, 0x0ea5e9, 0x1e293b);
      grid.position.y = -0.01;
      scene.add(grid);
      const grid2 = new THREE.GridHelper(30, 30, 0x0ea5e9, 0x1e293b);
      grid2.position.y = -0.02;
      grid2.rotation.x = Math.PI; // subtle visual depth layer
      grid2.position.y = -0.02;
      scene.add(grid2);

      /* ── Star fields (two counter-rotating layers) ── */
      function buildStars(count, size, color, opacity) {
        const geo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();
        const arr = new Float32Array(count * 3);
        for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
          arr[i*3]   = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 160;
          arr[i*3+1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 90;
          arr[i*3+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 160;
        }
        geo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(arr, 3));
        const mat = new THREE.PointsMaterial({
          color, size, transparent: true, opacity, sizeAttenuation: false,
          blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending, depthWrite: false
        });
        const pts = new THREE.Points(geo, mat);
        scene.add(pts);
        return { mesh: pts, mat };
      }
      starLayerA = buildStars(450, 0.9, 0x7dd3fc, 0.85);
      starLayerB = buildStars(320, 0.6, 0x94a3b8, 0.55);

      /* ── Agent group ── */
      agentGroup = new THREE.Group();

      // Glowing glass core
      const coreGeo = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(0.5, 3);
      const coreMat = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({
        color: 0x38bdf8, emissive: 0x0284c7, emissiveIntensity: 0.9,
        roughness: 0.12, metalness: 0.15, clearcoat: 1.0, clearcoatRoughness: 0.1
      });
      coreMesh = new THREE.Mesh(coreGeo, coreMat);

      // Inner spark (small bright icosahedron inside)
      const sparkGeo = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(0.18, 2);
      const sparkMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xe0f2fe });
      const spark = new THREE.Mesh(sparkGeo, sparkMat);
      coreMesh.add(spark);

      // Gyro rings
      const ringMat1 = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x38bdf8, metalness: 0.85, roughness: 0.2 });
      const ringMat2 = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x2dd4bf, metalness: 0.9, roughness: 0.12 });
      outerRing = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.9, 0.03, 16, 100), ringMat1);
      innerRing = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TorusGeometry(0.72, 0.022, 16, 100), ringMat2);

      agentGroup.add(coreMesh, outerRing, innerRing);

      // Orbiting satellites
      for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
        const orb = new THREE.Mesh(
          new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.06, 12, 12),
          new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: i === 0 ? 0x2dd4bf : 0x7dd3fc })
        );
        orb.userData = { radius: 1.25 + i * 0.22, speed: 1.6 - i * 0.35, phase: (i * Math.PI * 2) / 3, plane: i };
        satellites.push(orb);
        agentGroup.add(orb);
      }

      agentGroup.position.set(0, 1, 0);
      scene.add(agentGroup);

      /* ── Motion trail (smooth line, rainbow-gradient comet) ── */
      const trailGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();
      const trailArr = new Float32Array(MAX_TRAIL * 3);
      const trailCol = new Float32Array(MAX_TRAIL * 3);
      trailGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(trailArr, 3));
      trailGeo.setAttribute('color', new THREE.BufferAttribute(trailCol, 3));
      const trailMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({
        vertexColors: true, transparent: true, opacity: 0.92, blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending
      });
      trailLine = new THREE.Line(trailGeo, trailMat);
      trailLine.frustumCulled = false;
      scene.add(trailLine);

      /* ── Target marker: pulsing ring + light beam ── */
      targetMarker = new THREE.Mesh(
        new THREE.RingGeometry(0.32, 0.5, 48),
        new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x2dd4bf, side: THREE.DoubleSide, transparent: true, opacity: 0 })
      );
      targetMarker.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;
      scene.add(targetMarker);

      beamMesh = new THREE.Mesh(
        new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.05, 0.16, 2.4, 12, 1, true),
        new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x2dd4bf, transparent: true, opacity: 0, blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending, depthWrite: false, side: THREE.DoubleSide })
      );
      beamMesh.position.y = 1.2;
      scene.add(beamMesh);

      /* ── Topic-aware decorations group ── */
      decoGroup = new THREE.Group();
      scene.add(decoGroup);

      /* ── Ghost chaser (Pac-Man style) ── */
      ghostGroup = new THREE.Group();
      const ghostBody = new THREE.Mesh(
        new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.42, 24, 24),
        new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xef4444, emissive: 0x7f1d1d, emissiveIntensity: 0.8, roughness: 0.35 })
      );
      const eyeMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xffffff });
      const pupMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x0f172a });
      const eyeGeo = new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.1, 12, 12);
      const pupGeo = new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.05, 10, 10);
      const e1 = new THREE.Mesh(eyeGeo, eyeMat); e1.position.set(-0.16, 0.14, 0.38);
      const e2 = new THREE.Mesh(eyeGeo, eyeMat); e2.position.set(0.16, 0.14, 0.38);
      const p1 = new THREE.Mesh(pupGeo, pupMat); p1.position.set(-0.16, 0.14, 0.5);
      const p2 = new THREE.Mesh(pupGeo, pupMat); p2.position.set(0.16, 0.14, 0.5);
      ghostGroup.add(ghostBody, e1, e2, p1, p2);
      ghostGroup.visible = false;
      scene.add(ghostGroup);

      // Ghost "next cell" prediction marker (pulsing ring + beam)
      ghostNextMarker = new THREE.Mesh(
        new THREE.RingGeometry(0.34, 0.5, 40),
        new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xf87171, side: THREE.DoubleSide, transparent: true, opacity: 0 })
      );
      ghostNextMarker.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;
      ghostNextMarker.visible = false;
      scene.add(ghostNextMarker);

      // Arrow from ghost to its predicted next cell
      const ghostArrGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();
      ghostArrGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(new Float32Array(6), 3));
      ghostArrow = new THREE.Line(
        ghostArrGeo,
        new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0xf87171, transparent: true, opacity: 0.7 })
      );
      ghostArrow.visible = false;
      scene.add(ghostArrow);

      /* ── Controls ── */
      controls = new THREE.OrbitControls(camera, renderer.domElement);
      controls.enableDamping = true;
      controls.dampingFactor = 0.06;
      controls.minDistance = 4;
      controls.maxDistance = 40;
      controls.maxPolarAngle = Math.PI / 2.05;
      controls.target.set(0, 1, 0);
      controls.autoRotate = true;
      controls.autoRotateSpeed = 1.4;

      window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
        camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;
        camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
        renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);
      });

      // Hover a numbered waypoint → tooltip explains why the agent chose that move
      renderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {
        const rect = renderer.domElement.getBoundingClientRect();
        mouseNDC.x = ((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 2 - 1;
        mouseNDC.y = -((e.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height) * 2 + 1;
        raycaster.setFromCamera(mouseNDC, camera);
        const el = document.getElementById('wp-info');
        const hits = raycaster.intersectObjects(wpPillars, false);
        if (hits.length) {
          const idx = hits[0].object.userData.idx;
          const s = steps && steps[idx] ? steps[idx] : null;
          el.innerHTML = s
            ? `<b>✦ Waypoint ${idx + 1}/${wpMarkers.length}</b> — <span class="text-slate-300">${esc(s.name || '')}: ${esc(s.detail || 'agent moves along this leg of the chosen path')}</span>`
            : `✦ Waypoint ${idx + 1}/${wpMarkers.length} — next decision cell on the chosen path`;
          el.classList.remove('opacity-0');
        } else {
          el.classList.add('opacity-0');
        }
      });

      animate();
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       2. ANIMATION LOOP
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    const clock = new THREE.Clock();

    function animate() {
      requestAnimationFrame(animate);
      const dt = clock.getDelta();
      const t = clock.elapsedTime;

      /* ── Continuous local rotations ── */
      outerRing.rotation.x += dt * 1.2;
      outerRing.rotation.y += dt * 1.8;
      innerRing.rotation.y -= dt * 2.4;
      innerRing.rotation.z += dt * 1.2;
      coreMesh.rotation.y += dt * 0.7;

      // Pulse the core (breathing effect)
      const pulse = 1 + Math.sin(t * 2.6) * 0.08;
      coreMesh.scale.set(pulse, pulse, pulse);
      coreMesh.material.emissiveIntensity = 0.8 + Math.sin(t * 3.1) * 0.35;

      // Satellites orbit / bob
      satellites.forEach((s, i) => {
        const a = t * s.userData.speed + s.userData.phase;
        s.position.set(
          Math.cos(a) * s.userData.radius,
          Math.sin(a * 1.3 + i) * 0.4,
          Math.sin(a) * s.userData.radius * (s.userData.plane % 2 ? -1 : 1)
        );
      });

      /* ── Star fields drift / twinkle ── */
      starLayerA.mesh.rotation.y = t * 0.012;
      starLayerB.mesh.rotation.y = -t * 0.008;
      starLayerA.mat.opacity = 0.65 + Math.sin(t * 1.7) * 0.2;
      starLayerB.mat.opacity = 0.4 + Math.cos(t * 1.3) * 0.15;

      /* ── Spline travel ── */
      if (isFlying && splineCurve) {
        // Curvature-aware, eased speed — glides out of corners, eases in/out
        const tg0 = splineCurve.getTangentAt(Math.min(animationProgress, 0.999));
        let spFactor = speedMul;
        spFactor *= 0.4 + 0.6 * THREE.MathUtils.smoothstep(animationProgress, 0, 0.14);      // ease-in launch
        spFactor *= 0.3 + 0.7 * (1 - THREE.MathUtils.smoothstep(animationProgress, 0.8, 1)); // ease-out land
        if (prevTangentValid && lastTangent.lengthSq() > 1e-6) {
          const ang = lastTangent.angleTo(tg0);
          spFactor *= THREE.MathUtils.clamp(1.7 / (1 + ang * 2.6), 0.45, 1.8); // slow into sharp turns
        }
        animationProgress += dt * 0.045 * spFactor;
        prevTangentValid = true;
        if (animationProgress >= 1) {
          animationProgress = 1;
          isFlying = false;
          setStatus('Arrived at target', 'ok');
          setChip('arrived');
          document.getElementById('step-line').textContent = steps.length
            ? `✓ Completed — all ${steps.length} phases shown`
            : '✓ Flight complete';
          if (steps.length && stepItems.length) {
            stepItems.forEach((el, i) => el.classList.toggle('step-active', i === steps.length - 1));
          }
          log('Flight complete — agent arrived at target waypoint.', '#5eead4');
          spawnRipples(splineCurve.getPointAt(1));
        }

        const p = splineCurve.getPointAt(animationProgress);
        const tg = splineCurve.getTangentAt(animationProgress);

        // Agent flies slightly above ground, follows spline
        agentGroup.position.set(p.x, p.y, p.z);
        agentGroup.lookAt(p.clone().add(tg));

        // Bank into turns (roll around forward axis)
        const bank = THREE.MathUtils.clamp((tg.x * 0.6 - tg.z * 0.4) * 1.8, -0.45, 0.45);
        agentGroup.rotateZ(bank);
        lastTangent.copy(tg);

        // Rainbow comet trail — hue shifts with progress so direction stays readable
        updateTrailColors(animationProgress);

        // Waypoint decision markers: flash as the agent commits to the next leg
        if (wpMarkers.length > 1) {
          const wIdx = Math.min(Math.floor(animationProgress * (wpMarkers.length - 1)), wpMarkers.length - 1);
          if (wIdx !== activeWp) {
            activeWp = wIdx;
            paintWaypoints(activeWp);
            wpMarkers[activeWp].userData.flash = 1;
          }
        }
        for (const w of wpMarkers) {
          if (w.userData.flash > 0) {
            w.userData.flash = Math.max(0, w.userData.flash - dt * 1.2);
            const s = 1 + w.userData.flash * 0.45;
            w.scale.set(s, s, s);
          }
        }

        // Cinematic follow camera — sits behind the agent, looks where it's going
        if (followMode) {
          camAnchor.copy(tg).multiplyScalar(-3.6).add(agentGroup.position);
          camAnchor.y = Math.max(1.1, agentGroup.position.y + 2.2);
          camera.position.lerp(camAnchor, dt * 2.4);
          controls.target.lerp(agentGroup.position, dt * 2.4);
        }

        // Trail
        trail.unshift(agentGroup.position.clone());
        if (trail.length > MAX_TRAIL) trail.pop();
        const posAttr = trailLine.geometry.attributes.position;
        for (let i = 0; i < MAX_TRAIL; i++) {
          const pt = trail[i] || agentGroup.position;
          posAttr.array[i*3]   = pt.x;
          posAttr.array[i*3+1] = pt.y;
          posAttr.array[i*3+2] = pt.z;
        }
        posAttr.needsUpdate = true;

        // Pellet collection (maze / Pac-Man style) — eats them as it passes
        if (pellets.length) {
          for (let i = 0; i < pellets.length; i++) {
            if (pellets[i].visible && pellets[i].position.distanceToSquared(agentGroup.position) < 0.9) {
              pellets[i].visible = false;
              eatenCount++;
            }
          }
          if (!pelletsDone && eatenCount >= pellets.length) {
            pelletsDone = true;
            log(`All ${pellets.length} pellets collected — maze clear!`, '#facc15');
          }
        }

        // Ghost chase: flies its own pursuit spline, shows predicted next cell
        if (ghostActive && ghostSpline) {
          ghostProgress += dt * ghostSpeed;
          if (ghostProgress >= 1) {
            ghostProgress = 1;
            ghostActive = false;
            document.getElementById('ghost-line').textContent = '👻 Ghost: chase complete — predicted path shown';
            log('👻 Ghost caught up — chase algorithm ran to completion.', '#f87171');
          } else {
            const gp = ghostSpline.getPointAt(ghostProgress);
            const gt = ghostSpline.getTangentAt(ghostProgress);
            ghostGroup.position.set(gp.x, gp.y, gp.z);
            ghostGroup.position.y += Math.sin(t * 3.2) * 0.05; // spooky bob
            ghostGroup.lookAt(gp.clone().add(gt));

            // Predicted next cell = the next waypoint ahead of current progress
            const span = ghostWaypoints.length - 1;
            const segIdx = Math.min(Math.floor(ghostProgress * span), span - 1);
            const nextIdx = Math.min(segIdx + 1, ghostWaypoints.length - 1);
            const next = ghostWaypoints[nextIdx];
            ghostNextMarker.position.set(next.x, 0.07, next.z);
            ghostNextMarker.material.opacity = 0.5 + Math.sin(t * 7) * 0.3;

            // Arrow from ghost to its predicted next cell
            const arrowPos = ghostArrow.geometry.attributes.position;
            arrowPos.array[0] = gp.x; arrowPos.array[1] = gp.y + 0.1; arrowPos.array[2] = gp.z;
            arrowPos.array[3] = next.x; arrowPos.array[4] = 0.15; arrowPos.array[5] = next.z;
            arrowPos.needsUpdate = true;

            document.getElementById('ghost-line').textContent =
              `👻 Ghost next: (${next.x.toFixed(1)}, ${next.z.toFixed(1)}) — intercepting`;
          }
        }

        // Step-by-step breakdown syncs with flight progress
        if (steps.length) {
          const idx = Math.min(Math.floor(animationProgress * steps.length), steps.length - 1);
          if (idx !== lastStep) {
            lastStep = idx;
            const s = steps[idx];
            document.getElementById('step-line').textContent = `Step ${idx + 1}/${steps.length} — ${s.name || ''}`;
            stepItems.forEach((el, i) => el.classList.toggle('step-active', i === idx));
            updatePhaseRibbon(idx);
          }
        }

        // Target marker pulses at end point
        const end = splineCurve.getPointAt(1);
        targetMarker.position.set(end.x, 0.06, end.z);
        beamMesh.position.set(end.x, 1.2, end.z);
        targetMarker.material.opacity = 0.45 + Math.sin(t * 6) * 0.3;
        beamMesh.material.opacity = 0.28 + Math.sin(t * 6) * 0.16;

        // Travel percentage HUD
        document.getElementById('travel-pct').textContent = Math.round(animationProgress * 100) + '%';
      } else {
        /* ── Idle: agent cruises a floating Lissajous path ── */
        updateTrailColors(0.58); // calm blue while cruising
        const ix = Math.cos(t * 0.45) * 3.4;
        const iz = Math.sin(t * 0.55) * 3.4;
        const iy = 1.0 + Math.sin(t * 0.9) * 0.55;
        agentGroup.position.lerp(new THREE.Vector3(ix, iy, iz), dt * 1.2);
        // subtle banking while drifting
        const bankIdle = Math.sin(t * 0.45) * 0.25;
        agentGroup.rotation.z = bankIdle;

        if (targetMarker.material.opacity > 0) {
          targetMarker.material.opacity = Math.max(0, targetMarker.material.opacity - dt);
          beamMesh.material.opacity = Math.max(0, beamMesh.material.opacity - dt * 3);
        }
      }

      /* ── Ripple expansion at arrival ── */
      for (let i = ripples.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        const r = ripples[i];
        r.userData.age += dt;
        if (r.userData.age < r.userData.delay) continue;
        const a = r.userData.age - r.userData.delay;
        const s = 0.4 + a * 2.6;
        r.scale.set(s, s, 1);
        r.material.opacity = Math.max(0, 0.85 - a * 0.42);
        if (a > 2) {
          scene.remove(r);
          ripples.splice(i, 1);
        }
      }

      controls.update();
      renderer.render(scene, camera);
    }

    function spawnRipples(pos) {
      const colors = [0x2dd4bf, 0x38bdf8, 0x22d3ee];
      colors.forEach((c, i) => {
        const ring = new THREE.Mesh(
          new THREE.RingGeometry(0.5, 0.62, 48),
          new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: c, side: THREE.DoubleSide, transparent: true, opacity: 0.9 })
        );
        ring.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;
        ring.position.set(pos.x, 0.06, pos.z);
        ring.userData = { age: 0, delay: i * 0.14 };
        scene.add(ring);
        ripples.push(ring);
      });
      log('Target waypoint reached — spatial ripples emitted.', '#a5b4fc');
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       3. GEMINI API CALL
    ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    const SYSTEM_PROMPT = `You are an AI study assistant for the course "ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE". When a question matches a syllabus topic, answer from it and tag the unit.
SYLLABUS:
UNIT-I Introduction to AI: History and Foundations of AI; Types of AI; Domain of AI; Intelligent Agents (Agents and Environments, Good Behavior / Concept of Rationality, Nature of Environments, Structure of Agents); Problem-Solving Agents; Search Algorithms; Uninformed Search Strategies (BFS, DFS, Uniform-Cost, depth-limited, iterative deepening, bidirectional).
UNIT-II Problem-Solving: Informed (Heuristic) Search (greedy best-first, A*); Local Search and Optimization (hill climbing, simulated annealing, genetic); Local Search in Continuous Spaces; Search with Nondeterministic Actions; Search in Partially Observable Environments; Online Search Agents and Unknown Environments.
UNIT-III Game Playing and CSP: Game Theory; Optimal Decisions in Games (minimax); Heuristic Alpha-Beta Tree Search; Monte Carlo Tree Search; Stochastic Games; Partially Observable Games; CSP definition; Constraint Propagation (arc consistency); Backtracking Search for CSPs; Case study: AI Tools and Frameworks.
UNIT-IV Logical Reasoning: Knowledge-Based Agents; Propositional Logic; Propositional Theorem Proving; Effective Propositional Model Checking; Agents Based on Propositional Logic; First-Order Logic Representation; Syntax and Semantics of FOL; Knowledge Engineering in FOL; Propositional vs FOL Inference; Forward Chaining; Backward Chaining; Resolution.
