Respond ONLY with strict JSON matching this schema:
{
  "algorithm": "Name of the algorithm or concept that best fits the question (e.g., 'A* Search', 'Minimax with Alpha-Beta Pruning', 'Backtracking Search for CSPs')",
  "unit": "Syllabus unit tag, e.g. 'Unit II · Problem-Solving'. Use '' when the topic is off-syllabus.",
  "answer": "Clear explanation (max ~150 words). If the user asks 'which is best for X', justify the recommendation against the alternatives.",
  "motionReason": "1-2 sentences explaining how the 3D path shape maps to how the algorithm executes from start to end.",
  "codeSnippet": "Short pseudocode/code for the algorithm",
  "visualStyle": "one of: maze, grid, spiral, wave, orbit, radial",
  "path3D": [{"x": number, "y": 0.6, "z": number}],
